<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Mesh Menu</span></h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="whs4">There are a number of editing functions in KUBE, which allow mesh manipulation. These functions may be accessed using the Mesh menu or Tools context menu from the entities tree while having a mesh selected.<span lang="EN-GB">&#160;</span><span style="text-decoration:none;">The Mesh Menu is divided in 6 sections as follow:</span></p>
