<p class="sub-head"><span lang="EN-GB"><a name="Mesh_modification_group"></a>Mesh modification group</span></p>
<table width="809" cellspacing="0" class="whs22">
<col class="whs23">
<col class="whs24">
<col>
<tr valign="top" class="whs25">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="145" class="whs26">
<p class="caption">Command</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="542" class="whs27">
<p class="caption">Description</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" class="whs28">
<p class="caption">Details</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs29">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="145" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table-func"><u style="text-decoration:none;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="text-decoration:none;">Triangles removing functions</span></u></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="542" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table"><u><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../Mesh/Visualisation_menu_files/image012.gif" width="359px" height="83px" border="0" class="img_whs32" alt=""></span></u></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table">&#160;</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs33">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="145" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Remove Faulty Areas</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="542" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB" style="text-decoration:none;">Removes triangles, which distort the image.</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table"><u><a href="../References/remove_faulty_areas.htm"><img src="../Working_with_Data/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs34" alt=""></a></u></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs33">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="145" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Remove Floating Meshes</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="542" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB">Removes regions of the object, which are isolated from the main mesh.</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/remove_floating_meshes.htm"><img src="../Working_with_Data/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs34" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs35">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="145" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Remove Duplicate Triangles</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="542" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB">Finds any triangles that have identical vertices in the mesh and removes the surplus triangles.</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/remove_duplicate_triangles.htm"><img src="../Working_with_Data/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs34" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs36">
<td colspan="3" rowspan="1" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table-func">Mesh Improvement Functions</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs37">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="145" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Fill</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="542" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB">Fills holes in selected areas of the mesh with less than the given number of edges.&#160;</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/fill.htm"><img src="../Working_with_Data/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs34" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs37">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="145" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table-func">Repair</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="542" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table">Removes faulty areas and fills them afterwards.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Repair.htm"><img src="../Working_with_Data/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs34" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs37">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="145" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Stitch</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="542" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB">Attempts to fill gaps in the mesh, by joining the boundaries of long thin holes.</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Stitch.htm"><img src="../Working_with_Data/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs34" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs37">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="145" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Weld</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="542" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table">Removes surplus triangles.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table"><u><a href="../References/weld.htm"><img src="../Working_with_Data/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs34" alt=""></a></u></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs36">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="145" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Instant Editing</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="542" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table"><span style="text-decoration:none;">Quickly apply different processing tools on small areas without any selection.</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table"><u><a href="../References/instant_editing.htm"><img src="../Working_with_Data/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs34" alt=""></a></u></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs38">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="145" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Cut (Polygonal<br>
Area)</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="542" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table">Deletes selected mesh triangles that fall into a drawn polygon or selected plane and generates a new hidden mesh entity from them.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table"><u><a href="../References/cut_polygonal_area.htm"><img src="../Working_with_Data/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs34" alt=""></a></u></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs36">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="145" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table-func">Cap</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="542" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table">Caps selected mesh areas.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table"><u><a href="../References/cap.htm"><img src="../Working_with_Data/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs34" alt=""></a></u></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head"><u style="text-decoration:none;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="text-decoration:none;"><a name="Mesh_features_group"></a>Mesh features group</span></u></p>
<table width="809" cellspacing="0" class="whs39">
<col class="whs40">
<col class="whs41">
<col class="whs42">
<tr valign="top" class="whs43">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="21.467%" class="whs26">
<p class="caption">Command</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="70.004%" class="whs27">
<p class="caption">Description</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="4.125%" class="whs44">
<p class="caption">Details</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs43">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="21.467%" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table-func"><u style="text-decoration:none;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="text-decoration:none;">Functions dealing with normals</span></u></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="70.004%" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../Mesh/Visualisation_menu_files/image013.gif" width="345px" height="66px" border="0" class="img_whs45" alt=""></span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="4.125%" class="whs46">
<p class="normal-table">&#160;</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs43">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="21.467%" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Flip Normals</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="70.004%" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB" style="text-decoration:none;">I</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="text-decoration:none;">nverts the normals of all selected polygons.</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="4.125%" class="whs46">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/flip_normals.htm"><img src="../Working_with_Data/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs47" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs43">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="21.467%" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Unify Normals</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="70.004%" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB" style="text-decoration:none;">U</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="text-decoration:none;">nifies all the polygon normals in the selected mesh.</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="4.125%" class="whs46">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/unify_normals.htm"><img src="../Working_with_Data/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs47" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs43">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="21.467%" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Unify Normals Interactive</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="70.004%" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB" style="text-decoration:none;">Detects a submesh and inverts the normals when clicking on a triangle with reverse normal (relative to view position.)&#160;</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="4.125%" class="whs46">
<p class="normal-table"><u style="text-decoration:underline; x-text-underline: normal; /*begin!kadov{{*/ text-decoration: underline; /*}}end!kadov*/"><a href="../References/unify_normals_interactive.htm"><img src="../Working_with_Data/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs47" alt=""></a></u></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs43">
<td colspan="3" rowspan="1" width="95.596%" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table-func">Mesh enhancement function</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs43">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="21.467%" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Reorganise</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="70.004%" class="whs31">
<p class="normal-table"><span lang="EN-GB">Reorganises mesh edges to follow detection feature lines (e.g. corners).</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="4.125%" class="whs46">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/reorganise.htm"><img src="../Working_with_Data/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs47" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head"><span lang="EN-GB"><a name="Topology"></a>Topology modification functions</span></p>
<table width="809" cellspacing="0" class="whs48">
